gametitle=Guilty Gear XX Accent Core Plus (NTSC-U) [SLUS-21847] (F233A433)
comment=ggmod build of mods/extra-page (games/ggmod). Standalone US SLUS-21847; see MENU-ACCEPTANCE.md for validation and conflicts.

[ggmod: GGMOD page in OPTIONS > EXTRA MENU]
author=retro-graphics-research
description=In OPTIONS > EXTRA MENU, L1/R1 switches to a GGMOD page: HITBOX VIEW (the debug COLLI view) and HUD on/off. Needs the EXTRA MENU unlocked (see menu codes).
